    "description": "ApplyPolygenicScore is an open-source R package on CRAN that parses genotype/dosage data from VCF files, matches variants to the component SNPs of an existing polygenic score, and computes individual polygenic scores via the additive weighted-sum-of-dosages model; it is peer-reviewed and demonstrated on a cancer patient cohort.",
